    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38862" root="ملج" body-key="m">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَلْجَانُ</span></b>  A man <i>who sucks the teats of his
camels,</i> (or <i>of his sheep</i> or <i>goats,</i> TA,) <i>by
reason of his avarice;</i> (S, K;) not milking
them lest he should be heard: (TA:) as also
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَصَّانُ</span>. (S.)

